OL,3,AKatie Price 'really shocked' by
OL,4,Aex-husband rape claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Price says she believed a teenage
OL,7,Fgirl who was allegedly raped by her
OL,8,Fex-husband was "afraid" after
OL,9,Fexchanging text messages with her, and
OL,10,Fthat she was "really shocked" to learn
OL,11,Fof the allegations.
OL,13,FPrice's ex-husband Kieran Hayler is on
OL,14,Ftrial accused of three counts of rape
OL,15,Fand one of sexual assault against the
OL,16,Fthen 13-year-old girl in West Sussex in
OL,17,F2016, all of which he denies.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
