OL,3,AKatie Price 'really shocked' by
OL,4,Aex-husband rape claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiving evidence behind a screen in the
OL,7,Fcourtroom on Monday, Price said that
OL,8,Fshe was told in texts between her and
OL,9,Fthe alleged victim that Hayler "had
OL,10,Ftried to kiss her" and "had done stuff
OL,11,Fto her".
OL,13,FShe added that when she confronted
OL,14,FHayler about the alleged rape, his
OL,15,F"response all the time was 'no I
OL,16,Fhadn't'".
